            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega una declaración de impresión al método <code>call</code> que imprima las variables <code>first</code> y <code>last</code> de la clase.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Contact\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  first = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  last = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Doe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  cell = \" /><text value=\"&quot;3112445656&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  email = \" /><text value=\"&quot;jdoe@gmail.com&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_cell\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.cell)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"call\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(self)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;calling...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    print(self.first, self.last)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"197\" endIndex=\"201\" /><option startIndex=\"201\" endIndex=\"202\" /><option startIndex=\"202\" endIndex=\"207\" /><option startIndex=\"207\" endIndex=\"208\" /><option startIndex=\"214\" endIndex=\"218\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"def\" /></content></option><optio